# Documentation map

Start every task by reading `DOCS/INDEX.md`. Then open only the linked doc for the area you will change.

- Talk to the user in Russian. Write all project docs and code comments in English.
- Single map: `DOCS/INDEX.md`. Update it in the same change when folders or public interfaces move.
- Domain language lives in `DOCS/GLOSSARY.md` (this repo's CONTEXT.md). Update a term the turn it is resolved.
- Record hard-to-reverse trade-offs in `DOCS/DECISIONS/` (`0001-slug.md`). Skip ADRs that are easy to reverse.
- Do not paste file trees, npm scripts, or types that already exist in the repo. Point to the file instead.
- After a public interface, apply-flow, or folder change: update the matching `DOCS/*.md` before calling the task done.
